{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act18d3_level_act18d3_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act18d3",
  "stageId": "act18d3_03",
  "title": "外來者",
  "storyCode": "SV-3",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a8ba89a6bb286177760df6a1916002d7815232cbebec25c99cadd9ce7309d3ed",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "看看你，依然在彷徨，仿佛一隻迷途的海魚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "（看他一眼）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "你想知道我帶她去了哪裡。你非常在意。我們的集會，你沒有資格參與，可你的眼神告訴我，你想知道我們將對她做什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "你是找回你們之間的手足之愛了嗎？你的內心是否在因為你的故交的遭遇而經受撕扯？感到不公？從而憤怒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "你在試圖找尋你看不見的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "當然，你當然可以這麼回答。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "你以為我想傷害她。你錯了，我是想幫她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "只有弄清楚她的——你們的痛苦根源來自哪裡，我才能更好地幫助你們切除癥結，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "就像你。你主動加入我們，你想溶進真正的海洋。等你完成這個任務，你骯髒的本質將得到淨化。這是海對你的恩賜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "而同樣的恩賜，最後也會給予你的故交們，只要她們能和你一樣，放下過去為敵時的狹見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "使你們團聚，這是第一步。理解你們，這是第二步。而到最後，你們也會理解我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "如果你能適當地減少一些廢話，我們共事起來還能更融洽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "我也可以說一些會使你高興的。你的故交——清醒的那個，她已經到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "斯卡蒂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "她不在這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "自然不在。沒有我的邀請，沒人能進入這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "她進城了，你知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "你表現出了意外，這很有趣。這座城市裡的聲音，我都聽見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "祂讚賞我做的一切，賜予了我力量，令我的生命進一步延展。我的感知，我的心靈，都不再受縛於你所見到的軀殼裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "我在靠近完美。我將收下你的嫉恨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "說回你的故交——她來得比預期的還快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "“深海獵人血脈相連”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "她並不知道什麼在等著她。只因為你帶走了另一個，她就追到了這裡，一刻都不曾休息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "真是令人驚歎的情誼。她知道你如今的樣子嗎？面對叛徒，她會怎麼做？是還信任你們的血脈聯繫、同僚舊情，還是一劍刺入你的身體？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "我很期待。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "（轉身就走）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "你不需要急著去找她。你做得很好。你將這一個帶回到她該待的地方，又將另一個引入了城。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "他會滿意的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "他？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "你不需要知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "現在我們只等待。等到那個時候到來，你自然可以找你的故交，去傳達我們的邀請。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "她未必會來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "她會來的。她會自己來找我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "又回來啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我們住的地方是北邊最好的房子，你看，這扇門還能關上。一扇能關上的門，在下雨天能幫你不少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "附近有人，兩個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "他們呀，他們平時就在這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "text": "一百三十、一百三十一、一百三十二......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "嗨，磚頭，今天過得好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "text": "一，二，三......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "抱歉啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "可憐的傢伙，他又得重新來。他總坐在這裡，數街上有幾塊磚。悄悄告訴你，每天數出來的結果都不大一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "還有，那是石柱，他喜歡繞著街上的柱子散步。陰雨天就不出來啦，他年紀不小了，沾了水腿會疼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你不用管他們，他們也不會管你，就像他們也不管我一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "進來吧，歌手。正式介紹一下，裡面就是我家了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "嗨，鐵皮。嗨，牆灰。你們醒啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（摸箱子）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "痛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "喂，木框。你又把這個外面的人帶到家裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "她不是壞人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "她是外面來的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "長凳都挺喜歡她的，對不對啊，小長凳？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "text": "嗚......嗷......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "別、別咬！歌手的裙子都要被咬壞啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......倒還不會壞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "沾滿了口水，就沒這麼漂亮了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "text": "嗷，嗷嗷......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "這孩子真的很喜歡你，歌手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你們瞧，長凳也想讓她留下來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "你在盤算的事。別以為，我不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "不會有，好結果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "沒有呀，我什麼打算都沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "怎麼說，隨你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "規則，不許打破。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "無論是你，還是她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "我會看著的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "我們走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "呼......總算走啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，你不用怕。鐵皮就是這樣的人。他看上去很凶，但也不會真的對我做什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "好吧，我知道你不怕，你比他們厲害得多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我就是想說，真要動手的話，哼，我也不會怕他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你在歎氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "這個桶空啦。盤子也是空的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "讓我想想......或許床底下還有一些吃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "這裡，床？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "是啊，看起來很奇怪嗎？你家裡的床不是鐵做的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我不大在意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "有些房子裡也能找到木頭床。木頭可有用哩。木頭可以燒，讓屋子變得又亮又暖和。有的時候你要是生病了，這裡的冬天可不好過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "欸嘿——瞧瞧，這是我的寶貝盒子。早上起來的時候塞得深了些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你可以幫我一把，把這些乾了的海草從我眼前拿開。不，別扔在地上，就算不能吃了，它們也還能墊床鋪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "好多東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "是啊，我把有用的都藏在這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "看看這個，這是我正在縫的衣服。最近磨好的貝殼針，比過去幾年的都要好用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "布料不大夠用，還得去城南好好翻翻，或許還有些埋更深的沒被拿走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "馬上天就要變冷了，我得加快些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "不，不行，長凳，你不能動這個衣服！這是要給佩特拉奶奶的，她咳嗽越來越厲害了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "這也不行！給我鬆手啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "text": "木框。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "說了多少次，不是木框，是畫框啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "還有，這個也不能吃，就算給你也沒用呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "木框......畫框？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你聽到他們這麼叫我了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我只知道你叫安妮塔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "安妮塔是我自己起的......我從佩特拉奶奶的故事裡聽來的，那個女孩和你一樣，很會唱歌。是不是比木框好聽多了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我們這裡的人，大多沒有名字。什麼順嘴喊什麼。磚頭總在數磚塊，鐵皮家外面圍著鐵皮柵欄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "他們叫我木框。因為佩特拉奶奶是從這塊畫框下面找到我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你說過自己的母親。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "她沒把我交給其他人，她夠勇敢了。在我出生的時候，我們這裡沒有孩子，孩子活不下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "那年頭沒人敢惹佩特拉奶奶......她把吃的分給我。你別看她現在身體不好，她是這城裡最厲害的人哩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "就連鐵皮都怕她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "現在好多啦。那個教士教會了我們如何活下去。你看長凳，還有那邊幾個孩子。我想我們這裡也能漸漸變得熱鬧起來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "text": "啊啊......啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "只要別亂拿我的東西，你就還是個好孩子，是不是啊，小長凳？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "別的被拿走了都沒關係。晚上睡覺的時候，我把這盒子藏好。他們不知道怎麼找。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "唉，我們這裡不分什麼你的我的。我明白藏東西不好。歌手，你不會說出去的對不對？你對我的東西也不感興趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你放心我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你是客人，佩特拉奶奶教過我，我們要好好招待客人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "有了，我就記得有。看吧，這裡還剩下一條鱗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "這氣味......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "是半個月前的，還算新鮮哩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "掰一下，這一半......給長凳。嘿，長凳，這裡還有吃的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "text": "啊......啊啊......（吞咽）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "好了，這一半給你，你吃完把骨頭剩下，我還能煮上一鍋湯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "食物，我去找就可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "可是還沒到日子呀！你現在出門，不可能找到食物的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "總要試試。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "咦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "說著說著就沒影了，真是個怪人啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......還跟著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "海邊。她到海邊去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "對，鐵皮，你想的真對。她要下海。她準備到海裡去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "時候，還不到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "教士說過的。要潮汐漲落一百次，我們下海，才被允許。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "鐵皮，我們不能來。海邊，不許來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "......這沒有意義。我們，阻止她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "阻止她？難道我們打得過她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "教士說，我們要等一百次，才能去。現在，只有九十九次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "她什麼都得不到。今天的海邊，什麼都沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "那她在找什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "鐵皮，這裡好冷，我好餓，我們不能來，你也不要問。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "海裡有什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "我不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "就算知道，又能怎樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "......我不知道。鐵皮，你說的，我都不知道。我不懂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "過去，我們最遠走到過哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "最西邊的西邊。好久了。那時候，我們個子，只有這麼高。城裡，吃的還能撿到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "邊界線。這個詞，不常用。我們看到了，這座城市的，邊緣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "那是你，鐵皮，不是我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "我那時候，餓暈了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "你說，要再走一段路。你要，推推運氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "......是碰碰運氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "嘖，你總是，話都說不明白。教士教了你那麼多年。你都學不會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "嘿嘿，鐵皮，有你。你能明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "那時候，你也這麼說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "你一直信我。你讓我拿了你的那份罐頭。我又走了一天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "然後你回來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "是的，我回來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "回來以後，你好幾天沒吃東西。我以為，你想餓死自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "我是想過。可餓死自己，又有什麼意義？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "反正過不了多久，大家都會死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "你嚇到我了。你那時候就這麼說。我不知道你在說什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "後來......教士來了。他來了，我才感到了變化。我們都有了變化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "教士，好的生活。他說我們能有。他說的是真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "是真的。因為......這是真理。他給我們看見的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "因為教士，我活了下來。我們都活了下來。這樣，很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "那條線，沒有人能跨過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "這條，海水的線嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "所有的線。就像木框做的陷阱。外面來的，都攔住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "我們也不要出去。這就是最好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "鐵皮......你的腳，快要沾到水！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "水......是的。我不要過去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "就算跨過去了......跨過去了，那裡可能也什麼都沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "呼......鐵皮，你總算停下了腳步。你剛剛嚇壞我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "你別像那樣，問這麼多問題。你一直問，跟木框差不多。她從來都是怪人，教士也說她不對，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "提問......幫不了我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "只有答案才有意義。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "你好厲害，鐵皮。教士說的話，就你記得最牢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "看，她一直在海邊走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "鐵皮，你要去哪裡？你也要跟著去？不，這不對，我們本來就，不能跟著她！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "我們打不過她，連我都知道，我們沒法趕走她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "她回不來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "那......那倒是很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "我想要她那個大箱子，裡面肯定有很多吃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "箱子不在。她帶走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "只有這個......這個，她放在了石頭上。我不知道這是什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "她一直拿著，應該是好東西吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "我能不能......能不能咬一口，鐵皮？我真的好餓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "（叮咚）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "這、這是什麼？我從來沒聽過這種聲音。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "（叮咚，叮咚）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "快停下來吧，鐵皮，這聲音讓我的胸口和牙齒抖個不停。你愛拿著它就拿著，我還是回去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "沒有意義。這個也沒有意義。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "這種沒用的東西。就該扔在地上。爛掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "一路跟著的，我以為是別人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "你，你回來了！這怎麼可能？這個時候，到海邊的，沒有人能回來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "你想去海裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我只在這附近走走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "海裡有什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "什麼都沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "這不可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "你也變得越來越古怪了，鐵皮。你還在問這些我不懂的問題，我們不是來阻止她的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "現在她往回走。我們可以回去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "你都看見了。你知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "鐵皮，你在發抖。你是不是生病了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "別過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "過來又怎樣？像剛才一樣，你把我們都打趴下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "海裡有東西，對不對？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "不要動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "啊啊啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "牆灰！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "這石頭......她的動作，真快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "這是我的嘴發出來的聲音嗎？鐵皮，我叫出了聲。我的心臟怦怦跳。我是不是也生病了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "我以為，你的腦袋會砰一下炸開。就跟被砸爛的貝殼一樣，露出裡面白花花的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民B",
      "text": "那樣我會死嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "下回試試就知道了。現在爛掉的是別的東西。我沒見過這種。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民A",
      "text": "它怎麼......還會動？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "逃吧，回城去。動作要快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "——記得把我的琴留下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
